  "name": "Combined Monitor (Toggle-Controlled)",
  "description": "Combined monitoring: checks all enabled automation toggles (overdue patrols, missed clock-ins, low battery, scheduled patrol generation, shift reminders, medical appointment reminders) in a single run every 10 minutes. Exits immediately if all toggles are disabled. The 10-minute cadence replaces the former 2-hour sweep so time-sensitive alerts (patrol due, missed clock-in, shift reminders, appointment reminders) are delivered close to their deadlines; every branch is idempotent (alert-existence gates, reminder_sent/alerts_sent watermarks, deterministic event keys) so the tighter tick never duplicates deliveries.",
